  CpuBus     16777216 bytes  R/W
  IO             1024 bytes  R/O
  WRAM         131072 bytes  R/W
  VRAM          65536 bytes  R/W
  CGRAM           512 bytes  R/W
  OAM             544 bytes  R/W
  SRAM              0 bytes  R/W
  APURAM        65536 bytes  R/W
status 0
action none
$ mem CpuBus 0 20
out 176
